# Agent handoff

**Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) at the project root** before implementing features, debugging production, or touching deploy/webhooks.

That file holds: architecture, completed session work, file map, env var **names**, deploy runbook, webhook runbook, and the **DO NOT** list (dev server, build, iCloud deploy, uncommitted deploy-prod trap).

## Cursor rules (concise)

| Rule | When |
|------|------|
| `local-ui-iteration.mdc` | Any local UI/HMR work — never kill port 3000 or run build |
| `deploy-on-complete.mdc` | Task finished → commit + deploy production |
| `editorial-line.mdc` | Product copy — neutral community platform, not religious authority |

